WEBVTT

00:00:01.060 --> 00:00:03.470
I'm sorry I'm late.

00:00:04.440 --> 00:00:07.850
I mean, I meant to save you earlier...

00:00:07.850 --> 00:00:12.270
But I decided to prioritize my promise 
to win the Friendship Cup—

00:00:12.270 --> 00:00:14.430
I don't care about that nonsense.

00:00:14.430 --> 00:00:17.110
Duel me right here, right now.

00:00:29.120 --> 00:00:31.000
Syun? Edo?

00:00:31.890 --> 00:00:34.380
You two... What are you doing here?

00:00:34.800 --> 00:00:37.840
Edo brought me back 
from the brink of death.

00:00:37.840 --> 00:00:41.920
And when I heard that Yuya, you, and the 
others had headed for Academia,

00:00:41.920 --> 00:00:43.610
I came running.

00:00:43.610 --> 00:00:47.820
He just insisted on coming to 
save his little sister himself.

00:00:47.820 --> 00:00:51.080
Edo told me that Ruri was in this tower.

00:00:51.080 --> 00:00:54.090
Kaito, what happened up there?

00:00:56.420 --> 00:00:59.040
I was pushed out. By Ruri.

00:00:59.570 --> 00:01:00.240
What?

00:01:00.840 --> 00:01:04.180
Your sister has changed...

00:01:06.210 --> 00:01:07.640
That's impossible.

00:01:08.050 --> 00:01:09.080
Ruri!

00:01:09.600 --> 00:01:11.080
Wait! It's dangerous!

00:01:11.080 --> 00:01:14.360
Something might be controlling her!

00:01:14.360 --> 00:01:15.550
Controlling?

00:01:15.550 --> 00:01:19.760
Yes... I've heard that the Professor has

00:01:19.760 --> 00:01:23.960
a duelist that can control people's minds.

00:01:24.530 --> 00:01:26.890
If Ruri's being controlled...

00:01:28.230 --> 00:01:30.340
Then, in the eastern tower, as well...

00:01:30.340 --> 00:01:31.370
Edo...

00:01:32.040 --> 00:01:35.670
A man named Hugo headed
 for the eastern tower.

00:01:35.670 --> 00:01:37.930
You tell Hugo the truth.

00:01:37.930 --> 00:01:39.220
I'll go after Syun!

00:01:40.820 --> 00:01:43.750
In a world split into four dimensions,

00:01:43.750 --> 00:01:47.520
four boys exist, all with the same face.

00:01:48.290 --> 00:01:51.320
Their dragons call to each other,

00:01:51.870 --> 00:01:54.600
almost as if seeking one another.

00:03:28.220 --> 00:03:32.990
The Bell That Triggers the Bite

00:03:33.830 --> 00:03:35.690
That hurt...

00:03:36.010 --> 00:03:38.070
Why would she do that?

00:03:42.050 --> 00:03:43.450
Oh, no!

00:03:43.450 --> 00:03:46.510
How could you do this?

00:03:46.510 --> 00:03:50.490
Throwing me on my precious 
D-Wheel, of all things...

00:03:50.490 --> 00:03:53.650
Hey, you aren't hurt, are you?

00:03:54.150 --> 00:03:55.610
Forget about that.

00:03:56.360 --> 00:03:58.080
And duel me.

00:03:58.510 --> 00:04:00.050
That's all you care about?

00:04:00.400 --> 00:04:05.290
Have you forgotten the feelings 
we put into this D-Wheel?!

00:04:07.540 --> 00:04:11.460
We couldn't afford a D-Wheel, so we 
decided to make one from scratch.

00:04:11.890 --> 00:04:15.280
We studied, saved our money,

00:04:15.280 --> 00:04:17.100
bought all the parts,

00:04:17.100 --> 00:04:19.070
and gradually put it together.

00:04:19.460 --> 00:04:23.240
We said we'd enter the Friendship 
Cup with it, and we'd win...

00:04:23.240 --> 00:04:25.240
Win with our duel.

00:04:26.260 --> 00:04:27.900
Remember, Rin!

00:04:28.630 --> 00:04:30.420
Who cares?

00:04:31.090 --> 00:04:32.880
Now, let's duel.

00:04:33.810 --> 00:04:36.090
Fine! I get it!

00:04:36.850 --> 00:04:40.310
We've always settled arguments 
with duels, after all!

00:04:40.310 --> 00:04:41.730
If you wanna do it that bad,

00:04:42.170 --> 00:04:44.170
I'll do it!

00:04:44.890 --> 00:04:45.820
Duel!

00:04:46.870 --> 00:04:48.490
I'll go first.

00:04:48.490 --> 00:04:52.370
I activate my spell card Chime of the Wind!

00:04:53.060 --> 00:04:58.480
Its effect lets me Special Summon a monster, 
from my deck, with the same name as

00:04:58.480 --> 00:05:00.610
"Windwitch — Ice Bell" in my hand!

00:05:02.080 --> 00:05:05.820
And I Normal Summon the 
Ice Bell in my hand, too!

00:05:08.060 --> 00:05:12.220
On a turn when I succeed in summoning 
or Special Summoning this monster,

00:05:12.220 --> 00:05:15.730
I can deal 500 damage to you.

00:05:16.100 --> 00:05:18.700
To start, I activate the first one's effect!

00:05:22.010 --> 00:05:24.770
Then, I activate the second one's effect!

00:05:25.990 --> 00:05:27.640
That's cold!

00:05:29.470 --> 00:05:33.190
How many times have I felt Ice 
Bell's effect since I was a kid?

00:05:33.190 --> 00:05:36.110
But it feels especially cold today...

00:05:36.110 --> 00:05:40.010
When two or more Windwitches 
are on my side of the field,

00:05:40.010 --> 00:05:45.180
I can Special Summon my Tuner Monster 
Windwitch — Snow Bell!

00:05:46.770 --> 00:05:51.960
Level 1 Snow Bell tunes 
my two Level 3 Ice Bells!

00:05:52.830 --> 00:05:58.570
Midwinter wind, make snow 
and ice my power, and blow.

00:05:59.570 --> 00:06:01.210
Synchro Summon!

00:06:01.590 --> 00:06:05.720
Appear, Level 7 Windwitch — Winter Bell!

00:06:07.180 --> 00:06:09.350
Winter Bell's monster effect!

00:06:09.880 --> 00:06:11.180
Once per turn,

00:06:11.180 --> 00:06:14.940
I can choose one Windwitch, Level 4 
or below, in my graveyard,

00:06:14.940 --> 00:06:16.890
and activate its effect.

00:06:17.320 --> 00:06:23.030
I choose Ice Bell, and deal 500 
points of damage to you!

00:06:26.840 --> 00:06:30.230
I set one card and end my turn.

00:06:30.790 --> 00:06:33.640
Well? Next, it's your turn.

00:06:33.640 --> 00:06:37.670
As long as we're here, I'll duel in the 
manner you're most accustomed to!

00:06:42.450 --> 00:06:43.760
Follow me!

00:06:43.760 --> 00:06:46.380
Rin! Where are you going?

00:06:47.890 --> 00:06:49.760
I knew it was strange...

00:06:49.760 --> 00:06:52.320
For her not to listen to this degree.

00:06:53.030 --> 00:06:55.950
She's acting like a completely 
different person, too.

00:06:55.950 --> 00:06:57.830
And that duel disk...

00:06:59.440 --> 00:07:04.280
When Academia kidnapped her, 
could they have done something to her?

00:07:05.740 --> 00:07:07.850
1500 damage on the first turn.

00:07:09.100 --> 00:07:11.540
She's as merciless as ever...

00:07:11.980 --> 00:07:16.270
If I want to learn if Rin's really changed, 
or if they've done something to her,

00:07:16.270 --> 00:07:19.020
I have to win this duel.

00:07:20.180 --> 00:07:21.520
My turn!

00:07:22.000 --> 00:07:26.520
I summon Speedroid Horse 
Stilts from my hand!

00:07:30.570 --> 00:07:32.840
And the effect of Horse Stilts

00:07:32.840 --> 00:07:37.000
lets me Special Summon Tuner Monster 
Speedroid Tri-Eyed Dice!

00:07:40.470 --> 00:07:45.400
Level 3 Tri-Eyed Dice tunes 
Level 4 Horse Stilts!

00:07:49.220 --> 00:07:52.170
Flap your beautiful and heroic wings,

00:07:52.170 --> 00:07:54.780
to strike the enemy at the speed of light!

00:07:54.780 --> 00:07:56.390
Synchro Summon!

00:07:56.890 --> 00:08:01.530
Appear, Level 7 Clear Wing Synchro Dragon!

00:08:04.140 --> 00:08:05.330
Look, Rin!

00:08:05.330 --> 00:08:08.670
It's the Clear Wing Synchro 
Dragon you love.

00:08:09.670 --> 00:08:12.300
You used to love watching 
it fly more than anything...

00:08:12.850 --> 00:08:17.350
You always used to say that I'd 
always win, as long as I had it.

00:08:18.010 --> 00:08:18.710
Rin!

00:08:19.250 --> 00:08:22.450
I activate my trap Lost Wind!

00:08:22.930 --> 00:08:26.460
I negate Clear Wing Synchro 
Dragon's monster effect,

00:08:26.460 --> 00:08:28.630
and halve its attack points!

00:08:32.740 --> 00:08:35.790
Why have you done this to Clear Wing?

00:08:35.790 --> 00:08:37.500
Why?

00:08:39.330 --> 00:08:40.970
Because it's an eyesore.

00:08:41.510 --> 00:08:44.430
The Parasite Monster that I invented

00:08:44.430 --> 00:08:48.380
can directly control the mind of 
the player it takes as a host.

00:08:48.380 --> 00:08:52.460
It draws from the player's memory 
data and analyzes it.

00:08:52.460 --> 00:08:56.920
Someone the host knows as well as
 she does doesn't stand a chance.

00:08:57.210 --> 00:08:58.800
What do you think?

00:08:58.800 --> 00:09:04.860
Parasite Monster has been programmed to 
feel absolute loyalty to you, Professor.

00:09:04.860 --> 00:09:08.130
I acknowledge the fruits 
of your research, Doctor.

00:09:08.600 --> 00:09:13.960
But that girl is one of the keystones 
to our Aquaria Project.

00:09:13.960 --> 00:09:15.600
Do not be reckless with her.

00:09:15.600 --> 00:09:20.810
It is because she is so precious that 
I took measures to protect her.

00:09:21.070 --> 00:09:22.680
Do not worry.

00:09:22.680 --> 00:09:25.880
My Parasite Monster is perfect!

00:09:27.920 --> 00:09:30.520
What? Your father?

00:09:30.520 --> 00:09:31.360
Yeah.

00:09:31.360 --> 00:09:35.550
My father was heading for Academia, 
to try to reason with the Professor.

00:09:35.550 --> 00:09:38.200
We were going after him.

00:09:38.820 --> 00:09:42.290
But what's your father doing at Academia?

00:09:42.560 --> 00:09:47.180
It is most likely because he 
means to keep his promise

00:09:47.180 --> 00:09:48.970
from three years ago.

00:09:49.410 --> 00:09:50.490
Promise?

00:09:50.490 --> 00:09:51.700
What do you mean?

00:09:52.120 --> 00:09:57.130
Three years ago, I secretly crossed 
dimensions to Academia.

00:09:58.320 --> 00:10:02.960
That is where I learned that Leo Akaba 
was trying to use the power of duels

00:10:02.960 --> 00:10:05.160
to take control of the four dimensions.

00:10:05.620 --> 00:10:10.760
To stop his ambitions, 
I sought aid from your father.

00:10:11.200 --> 00:10:12.220
From my father?

00:10:12.760 --> 00:10:15.130
And without telling anyone,

00:10:15.130 --> 00:10:18.820
he used the dimensional 
transport and disappeared.

00:10:19.700 --> 00:10:21.160
I see...

00:10:21.160 --> 00:10:24.620
Both times, he did the same thing.

00:10:25.180 --> 00:10:27.170
That's why he's going to the Professor?

00:10:27.170 --> 00:10:29.450
At that same time, three years ago,

00:10:29.450 --> 00:10:33.230
Leo Akaba and I also met a girl.

00:10:33.230 --> 00:10:34.150
A girl?

00:10:34.460 --> 00:10:36.220
That was Serena.

00:10:36.220 --> 00:10:38.270
And three years later...

00:10:38.270 --> 00:10:41.200
Yuya, when I met you and Yuzu,

00:10:41.200 --> 00:10:43.860
it revived a certain memory.

00:10:43.860 --> 00:10:45.070
A memory?

00:10:45.070 --> 00:10:46.360
What was it?

00:10:46.360 --> 00:10:48.970
It was of Leo Akaba's research.

00:10:49.780 --> 00:10:51.030
Revival Zero.

00:10:51.440 --> 00:10:54.000
Revival Zero?

00:10:54.000 --> 00:10:55.800
A revival from zero?

00:10:55.800 --> 00:10:59.200
A return to zero? What does it mean?

00:10:59.550 --> 00:11:05.310
I am afraid I still do not entirely 
understand its meaning.

00:11:06.080 --> 00:11:10.420
The folder only contained files on two people.

00:11:10.420 --> 00:11:12.490
Two people?

00:11:12.490 --> 00:11:16.110
One was Serena's file. The other...

00:11:16.110 --> 00:11:17.390
What was it?

00:11:18.390 --> 00:11:20.860
It was on a boy named Joeri.

00:11:21.410 --> 00:11:25.100
Yes, The boy you said 
you met before, Yuya.

00:11:25.100 --> 00:11:28.330
The boy with your face 
from the Fusion Dimension.

00:11:28.600 --> 00:11:29.920
That means...

00:11:29.920 --> 00:11:33.470
I believe your hypothesis is correct. 
That the four identical girls,

00:11:33.470 --> 00:11:37.910
in the four dimensions, are connected 
to the Aquaria Project.

00:11:38.680 --> 00:11:40.350
Revival Zero...

00:11:40.350 --> 00:11:45.240
Surely, this is at the heart 
of Leo Akaba's plan.

00:11:45.240 --> 00:11:47.740
And given the existence of Joeri...

00:11:47.740 --> 00:11:50.660
Yuya, you must be connected, too.

00:11:51.040 --> 00:11:54.220
I'm involved in Academia's plan?

00:11:54.870 --> 00:11:56.860
Can it be... Are we...

00:11:57.350 --> 00:12:00.560
But watching their movements so far,

00:12:00.560 --> 00:12:02.790
Joeri seems the only one he's watching.

00:12:03.600 --> 00:12:05.840
I hope I'm just worrying too much.

00:12:06.170 --> 00:12:09.540
But if bringing all four girls together

00:12:09.540 --> 00:12:12.920
will complete Leo Akaba's plan,

00:12:12.920 --> 00:12:15.810
nothing that might happen 
would surprise me.

00:12:16.640 --> 00:12:18.750
No matter what becomes of you Lancers,

00:12:18.750 --> 00:12:22.980
I want you to trust in the power of 
your allies. And fight to the end.

00:12:27.770 --> 00:12:31.930
I don't know what Academia did 
to you after they captured you.

00:12:31.930 --> 00:12:34.430
But right now, you aren't the Rin I know!

00:12:35.240 --> 00:12:39.140
If you've also forgotten me, 
I'll make you remember!

00:12:39.600 --> 00:12:40.840
With my duel!

00:12:41.230 --> 00:12:44.310
I set one card and end my turn!

00:12:47.170 --> 00:12:49.080
Make her remember?

00:12:49.810 --> 00:12:52.520
Go ahead and try...

00:13:02.050 --> 00:13:03.730
My turn!

00:13:06.160 --> 00:13:07.100
Battle!

00:13:07.100 --> 00:13:11.900
I attack Clear Wing Synchro Dragon 
with Windwitch — Winter Bell!

00:13:15.040 --> 00:13:20.260
I negate the attack by banishing 
Tri-Eyed Dice in my graveyard!

00:13:22.280 --> 00:13:24.350
I anticipated you'd do that.

00:13:24.680 --> 00:13:30.320
I activate Quick-Play Spell Call of the 
Windwitch, targeting Winter Bell!

00:13:31.230 --> 00:13:36.060
I can Special Summon one monster, the same 
level or lower as the target, from my hand.

00:13:36.630 --> 00:13:39.990
I call Fusion Parasite!

00:13:40.500 --> 00:13:42.470
What's that creepy thing?

00:13:43.060 --> 00:13:45.460
Did Rin ever have that monster?

00:13:46.070 --> 00:13:49.770
When Fusion Parasite is Special 
Summoned successfully,

00:13:49.770 --> 00:13:53.150
I can use it as a component, to Fusion Summon

00:13:53.150 --> 00:13:54.850
without a Polymerization card!

00:13:55.180 --> 00:13:56.910
What? Fusion?

00:13:57.460 --> 00:14:02.590
I fuse Windwitch — Winter Bell 
and Fusion Parasite!

00:14:02.990 --> 00:14:06.010
Sound of the wind that rushes 
over midwinter fields,

00:14:06.010 --> 00:14:10.330
become one with my voice, 
and ring out even more violently.

00:14:10.330 --> 00:14:12.200
Fusion Summon!

00:14:14.330 --> 00:14:18.240
Appear, crystal bell that 
rings with sublime tones,

00:14:18.570 --> 00:14:21.240
Windwitch — Crystal Bell!

00:14:23.550 --> 00:14:26.140
Rin summoned a Fusion Monster?

00:14:26.140 --> 00:14:30.190
When Fusion Parasite is used 
as a Fusion component,

00:14:30.190 --> 00:14:33.040
it becomes an equipment card 
for that Fusion Monster.

00:14:35.900 --> 00:14:38.870
Rin, have you really joined Academia?

00:14:39.390 --> 00:14:41.340
Indeed...

00:14:41.340 --> 00:14:46.350
Right now, Rin is fighting for 
Academia of her own free will.

00:14:46.350 --> 00:14:49.330
The Rin you knew is gone.

00:14:49.680 --> 00:14:50.800
Battle!

00:14:50.800 --> 00:14:55.240
I attack Clear Wing Synchro 
Dragon with Crystal Bell!

00:15:16.940 --> 00:15:18.460
Our...

00:15:19.090 --> 00:15:22.150
The D-Wheel... that Rin and I made...

00:15:24.320 --> 00:15:26.870
What's the matter? Stand up already.

00:15:27.570 --> 00:15:29.470
The duel isn't over yet.

00:15:30.780 --> 00:15:32.340
You!

00:15:32.340 --> 00:15:34.620
You've really forgotten?!

00:15:34.620 --> 00:15:38.130
The dreams we put into this D-Wheel!

00:15:38.130 --> 00:15:40.420
Our hopes... Our future!

00:15:40.740 --> 00:15:42.120
Remember!

00:15:43.090 --> 00:15:47.780
How we felt back then, when we 
chased our dream together!

00:15:48.260 --> 00:15:49.460
Rin!

00:15:49.780 --> 00:15:51.930
Crystal Bell's effect activates.

00:15:52.480 --> 00:15:57.400
I can choose one monster in the 
graveyard and use its effect.

00:15:57.820 --> 00:16:00.680
I choose Ice Bell.

00:16:00.680 --> 00:16:05.140
Its effect deals 500 points of damage to you.

00:16:10.720 --> 00:16:13.280
Your life is down to 450.

00:16:13.720 --> 00:16:15.210
I am unharmed.

00:16:15.650 --> 00:16:17.760
You can no longer use your D-Wheel, either.

00:16:17.760 --> 00:16:20.490
It's clear that you can't win, isn't it?

00:16:20.880 --> 00:16:23.460
Now, hurry up and surrender.

00:16:23.460 --> 00:16:25.770
Surrender?

00:16:25.770 --> 00:16:30.430
That's the one word... I'll never say.

00:16:31.010 --> 00:16:34.910
Sorry to say it, but I'm... pretty stubborn.

00:16:35.600 --> 00:16:39.710
That's why I crossed dimensions, 
searching for you...

00:16:40.030 --> 00:16:45.180
After I finally found you again, 
no way am I giving up.

00:16:45.810 --> 00:16:50.650
No matter what, I'll bring you 
back to your senses, Rin!

00:16:51.160 --> 00:16:54.130
Now, end your turn already!

00:16:54.520 --> 00:16:56.090
It's my turn next!

00:16:57.400 --> 00:16:59.800
I now end my turn.

00:17:00.160 --> 00:17:03.320
He certainly is stubborn.

00:17:03.320 --> 00:17:07.000
But I wonder what he can do, with his 
back against the wall like this.

00:17:07.000 --> 00:17:08.710
My turn!

00:17:10.610 --> 00:17:11.440
It's here!

00:17:11.440 --> 00:17:15.060
I summon Tuner Monster Red-Eyed Dice!

00:17:16.650 --> 00:17:22.620
And I activate my spell card Shadow 
Stepper, targeting Crystal Bell!

00:17:23.050 --> 00:17:28.300
I can Special Summon a monster from my graveyard, 
previously summoned from my Extra Deck,

00:17:28.300 --> 00:17:31.360
of a lower level than the target monster, with its effect negated!

00:17:31.570 --> 00:17:35.060
I call back Clear Wing Synchro Dragon!

00:17:35.880 --> 00:17:41.900
Level 1 Red-Eyed Dice tunes Level 7 
Clear Wing Synchro Dragon!

00:17:44.230 --> 00:17:47.310
Let the clear wings, infused with holy power,

00:17:47.310 --> 00:17:49.480
shine and strike at the enemy!

00:17:49.880 --> 00:17:51.620
Synchro Summon!

00:17:51.950 --> 00:17:57.220
Appear, Level 8 Crystal 
Wing Synchro Dragon!

00:17:59.610 --> 00:18:00.760
Battle!

00:18:00.760 --> 00:18:03.090
Go, Crystal Wing Synchro Dragon.

00:18:05.280 --> 00:18:09.740
When Crystal Wing Synchro Dragon does 
battle with a monster of Level 5 or above,

00:18:09.740 --> 00:18:13.830
it adds the opponent monster's 
attack points to its own!

00:18:14.960 --> 00:18:17.260
Fusion Monsters don't suit you, Rin.

00:18:17.260 --> 00:18:21.510
I'll crush that fake crystal monster of yours!

00:18:21.950 --> 00:18:25.280
With my wings of true crystal!

00:18:25.940 --> 00:18:27.990
I activate Crystal Bell's effect.

00:18:28.360 --> 00:18:31.220
I choose a monster in either of our graveyards,

00:18:31.890 --> 00:18:37.230
and until the End Phase, its effect may 
be activated as Crystal Bell's effect.

00:18:37.230 --> 00:18:41.260
I choose Clear Wing Synchro Dragon!

00:18:41.260 --> 00:18:42.170
What?

00:18:42.170 --> 00:18:47.210
Its effect lets me negate the effect 
of a monster, Level 5 or above,

00:18:47.210 --> 00:18:49.140
and destroy it!

00:18:49.600 --> 00:18:51.110
But I won't let you do it!

00:18:51.490 --> 00:18:53.880
I use Crystal Wing Synchro Dragon's effect

00:18:53.880 --> 00:18:57.690
to negate Crystal Bell's effect, destroying it!

00:19:00.050 --> 00:19:03.270
Then, I negate its destruction by

00:19:03.270 --> 00:19:07.480
sending Fusion Parasite, equipped to 
Crystal Bell, to the graveyard!

00:19:08.360 --> 00:19:10.830
Then, I attack Crystal Bell!

00:19:21.700 --> 00:19:24.980
Rin! Are you okay, Rin?

00:19:25.700 --> 00:19:27.950
Hey, speak to me, Rin!

00:19:28.470 --> 00:19:30.920
Hey, open your eyes, Rin... Hey!

00:19:30.920 --> 00:19:32.730
Hey! Rin!

00:19:33.270 --> 00:19:34.390
Rin!

00:19:35.330 --> 00:19:38.360
Hugo...

00:19:40.050 --> 00:19:41.160
You're back...

00:19:42.070 --> 00:19:43.530
The Rin I know...

00:19:44.310 --> 00:19:45.270
Rin!

00:19:50.680 --> 00:19:52.040
Rin!

00:19:56.210 --> 00:19:59.040
The destruction of Crystal Bell

00:19:59.490 --> 00:20:05.550
Special Summons Winter Bell and 
Fusion Parasite in my graveyard.

00:20:05.870 --> 00:20:06.780
Rin!

00:20:09.960 --> 00:20:15.850
And Fusion Parasite's effect fuses them,

00:20:15.850 --> 00:20:18.580
to restore Crystal Bell.

00:20:20.280 --> 00:20:24.520
Fusion Parasite becomes its equipment card.

00:20:27.060 --> 00:20:29.140
No... Why?

00:20:29.470 --> 00:20:32.800
Sorry to say it, but my Parasite Monster

00:20:32.800 --> 00:20:36.220
is as stubborn as you are.

00:20:36.220 --> 00:20:38.620
No, even more stubborn...

00:20:40.880 --> 00:20:41.850
That's it?

00:20:42.260 --> 00:20:44.660
The one fusing Rin's monster?

00:20:45.160 --> 00:20:47.210
That bug's doing this to Rin?

00:20:48.630 --> 00:20:51.100
Crystal Bell's monster effect.

00:20:51.450 --> 00:20:55.240
I activate the effect of Ice 
Bell in the graveyard,

00:20:55.240 --> 00:20:59.570
to deal my opponent 500 points of damage.

00:21:00.290 --> 00:21:00.910
Rin!

00:21:09.710 --> 00:21:11.280
Beautifully done, Rin.

00:21:11.280 --> 00:21:13.100
Now, come back.

00:21:13.100 --> 00:21:15.120
The Professor is waiting.

00:21:26.290 --> 00:21:27.330
Serena!

00:21:28.550 --> 00:21:30.000
What's going on?

00:21:30.000 --> 00:21:32.680
You fought as one of the Lancers in City.

00:21:32.680 --> 00:21:35.040
The Lancers were just a brief diversion.

00:21:35.430 --> 00:21:37.820
I serve the Professor.

00:21:42.470 --> 00:21:43.510
Serena...

00:21:49.680 --> 00:21:52.920
Hey, we really have to climb this thing?

00:21:52.920 --> 00:21:58.460
Yeah, this is the quickest way to the 
Professor's lab from the harbor.

00:21:58.460 --> 00:22:02.330
Head straight for the enemy HQ, right?

00:22:02.330 --> 00:22:03.130
Interesting!

00:22:03.490 --> 00:22:05.510
Yuzu... Dad...

00:22:07.540 --> 00:22:09.040
All right, let's go!

00:22:09.300 --> 00:22:10.230
Yeah!

00:23:49.330 --> 00:23:54.670
Academia is the birthplace 
of proud duel warriors.

00:23:54.670 --> 00:23:57.930
I've devised a most amusing game for you.

00:23:57.930 --> 00:23:59.560
Amusing game?

00:23:59.560 --> 00:24:02.990
What nonsense is this? 
Why bring us here?

00:24:02.990 --> 00:24:07.950
Now, you five will battle my five 
elite warriors in a battle royal.

00:24:07.950 --> 00:24:11.460
Until only one is standing!

00:24:11.460 --> 00:24:15.400
Next time on Yu-Gi-Oh! ARC-V: 
Survival Duel.

00:24:15.400 --> 00:24:17.450
The fun is only getting started!
